    },
    {
      "text": "Sleep also seems to clean the brain. Studies suggest that during deep sleep, liquid flows through the brain and carries away waste that collected during the day. It is like a cleaning team that works at night.",
      "ja": "ねむりは脳のそうじもしているらしい。研究によると、深いねむりの間に液体が脳の中を流れ、昼間にたまったごみを運び去る。夜に働くそうじチームのようなものだ。",
