    {
      "text": "The body is busy too. Children and teenagers grow mostly during deep sleep, and the body repairs muscles. People who do not sleep enough catch colds more easily, because their defenses become weaker.",
      "ja": "体もいそがしい。子どもや十代は主に深いねむりの間に成長し、体は筋肉を修理する。ねむりが足りない人は、体を守る力が弱くなるので、かぜをひきやすい。",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "night",
