            "a": "bob"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "However, school still begins early. As a result, many teenagers get less than the eight to ten hours they need. Some schools that started later reported that students were more awake and achieved better results.",
      "ja": "しかし学校は早く始まる。その結果、多くの十代は必要な8〜10時間より少ししかねむれない。始業をおそくした学校の中には、生徒がよく目ざめ、よい成績を達成したと報告したところもある。",
      "scene": {
